Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:24:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] dev-nle: tree of the local 142bd497 (dev-sampler aa66e11d
 merged into dev-nle)

The final-sampler merge was never pushed; this commit carries its tree
from the git archive in the NLE repository (handover/emc2/
emc2_142bd497.tar.gz) on top of origin/dev-nle 154f21ad, after the
scaled-DDM patch. The NN layer is identical in the two trees, so the
patch applies unchanged.

